What is Google ADK?	Google's framework for developing, orchestrating and evaluating AI agents.
What is orchestration?	Coordinating agents, tasks and their execution sequence.
What is fallback handling?	An alternative response or execution path when the primary operation fails.
Why Pydantic?	Data validation and schema enforcement.
